<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Hwang-DBS 6-mth net doubles.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Hwang-DBS 6-mth net doubles.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Jan 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  57.13   vs	  25.54</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 22.85   vs	  15.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		   105.85   vs	  39.33</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  81.87   vs	  36.53</p>
<p>    Dividend  (pct)	    5.0    vs	   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hwang-DBS (Malaysia) Bhd is in the stockbroking and financial services businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
